    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GPT-5.6 Sol on levin-2018-hcn2-10: needs-new-data, resolvability 0.62";
    dc:description "The proportion contrast is straightforward to test, but the unusually strict morphology endpoint depends on underlying blinded classifications rather than figure summaries. Without deposited individual observations or an independent replication, a decisive reanalysis would require new data.";
    dc:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/dataset-resolvability-0.2.0>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Using blinded embryo-level morphology scores, compare minor-defect proportions between untreated and Hcn2-injected embryos and test the stated reduction from roughly 9% to 1.5% with uncertainty and batch controls.";
