    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/assessmentType> "dataset-resolvability/0.2.0";
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/evidenceAgainst> "Minor deviation scoring is subjective and requires blinded raw observations.", "No open individual-level morphology dataset is identified.";
